00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.640
SETH VARGO: In this episode
of the Secret Manager video

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:06.180
series, we'll talk about how
Secret Manager automatically

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:08.730
versions your secret payloads.

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:11.640
Should you pin your applications
to a specific version

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:13.260
or always use latest?

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:14.520
Stay tuned to find out.

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:17.604
